  "description": "Checkpointed, resumable, conflict-safe, watchdog-alarmed, UI-visible background jobs — the storage-agnostic core. Single-flight claim, heartbeated lease, compare-and-set transitions (0-row = benign no-op), resume-from-checkpoint on reclaim. Now with a pluggable real-time status backplane (persist-first-push-second) for opt-in cross-pod PUSH.",
